<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Pioneer half year net profit falls.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Pioneer half year net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended Dec 31</p>
<p>		(million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 156.7 vs 182.5</p>
<p>    Net profit			 112.7 vs 138.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   9.0 vs  9.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Pioneer International Ltd is a building products and petroleum group.  </p>
<p>    Sales (billion)		   1.57 vs  1.56</p>
<p>    Other income			68.3 vs  90.0</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			 12.7 vs  15.1</p>
<p>Dividend is 50 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date April 1</p>
<p>Reg date March 12</p>
<p>    Tax				   43.3 vs  41.7</p>
<p>    Interest			    43.1 vs  43.6</p>
<p>    Depreciation			66.1 vs  66.4</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
